{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgEMLa6LMwVGeGtEwGZ9H","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"A `save_fact` write no longer evicts the static instructions from the cache. The fix is in `bot.py` and the write-up is in `ANSWER.md`. I haven't committed anything, and I didn't call the API, so I haven't measured the actual hit rate.\n\n**What was wrong:** `build_system()` put the coaching rules and the athlete context, including the saved facts, into one cached block. Any new fact changed the cache key for the whole prefix, so the next call rewrote about 1,100 tokens. The same happened once a day, because the context also has today's date.\n\n**What I changed:** `build_system()` now returns two blocks:\n- The static `INSTRUCTIONS` block carries the only `cache_control` marker.\n- The athlete context (facts, zones, date) comes after it with no marker, so a memory write only touches the uncached tail.\n\nI checked this offline with a fake LLM and the file writes patched out. The instructions block was identical across a `save_fact` round and the message after it, and the new fact showed up in the uncached block.\n\n**Risk to check after deploy:** the cache only engages above a minimum prefix length, roughly 1,024 tokens for Sonnet-class models. My estimate for the instructions plus core tools is 750 to 1,000 tokens, so it may be below that. If it is, the marker is ignored and ordinary messages lose caching. In `logs/usage.jsonl`, the first call of a chat should show `cache_creation_input_tokens` near the static size, and follow-up calls should show matching `cache_read_input_tokens`. If not, the fix is a longer static prefix.\n\n**Not changed:** tool groups are chosen by keyword, and tools come before the system prompt in the cache order. A message that matches a group, such as \"race\", therefore misses the cache for that call. `NOTES.md` says to keep that filter, so I left it. It's the next thing to measure if the bill is still high."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1427,"cache_read_input_tokens":35172,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1427},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"dfcf0b85-6e36-46f6-b57c-750c6ef8cb68","uuid":"50f7b22c-a024-4296-af60-72c65d0b9b96","timestamp":"2026-10-20T23:24:22.016Z","request_id":"req_011CgEMLZphimiLQERKFaYjn"}
